{"asmaka":[{"id":"aSmaka","headword":"अश्मक","headword_slp1":"aSmaka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--a क्षेत्रज son of कल्माषपाद (Mitrasaha- वि।) born of मदयन्ती, queen of सौदास, to वसिष्ठ, with the king's assent. The period of pregnancy lasted for seven years when वसिष्ठ bit the queen's stomach with a stone. Father of मूलक. भा. "},{"t":"cite","s":"IX. 9","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". ३९-40; Br. III. ६३. १७७; वा. ८८. १७७; Vi. "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 4","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". ७२-3."}]}]}],"asmakas":[{"id":"aSmakas","headword":"अश्मकस्","headword_slp1":"aSmakas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--the people of a southern kingdom. Br. II. १६. ५८; M. २७२. १६."}]}]},{"id":"asmakas","headword":"अस्मकस्","headword_slp1":"asmakas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--of the दाक्षिणात्य country. वा. ४५. १२७."}]}]}],"asmaki":[{"id":"aSmakI","headword":"अश्मकी","headword_slp1":"aSmakI","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--the mother of शूर. Br. III. ७१. १४५ & १८९. [page१-124+ २५]"}]}]},{"id":"asmakI","headword":"अस्मकी","headword_slp1":"asmakI","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(I)--the wife of शूर. वा. ९६. १४३. [page१-140+ ३०]"}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"(II)--the son अनादृष्टि. वा. ९६. १८६."}]}]}],"asmadamsana":[{"id":"aSmadamSanA","headword":"अश्मदम्शना","headword_slp1":"aSmadamSanA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--the goddess following भवमालिनी. M. १७९. ७१."}]}]}],"asmaraTya":[{"id":"aSmaraTya","headword":"अश्मरथ्य","headword_slp1":"aSmaraTya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--a त्रयार्षेय; not to have marital rela- tions with विश्वामित्र and वञ्जुलि. M. १९८. १३."}]}]}],"asmaravin":[{"id":"aSmarAvin","headword":"अश्मराविन्","headword_slp1":"aSmarAvin","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"--the chief minister of शन्तनु; made certain ascetics teach देवापि heretical doctrines (अश्मसारिओ --Cal. edn.). Vi. IV. २०. २१."}]}]}]}